[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14041.269, "timestamp": "03:54:01", "text": "寿司龙？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14048.79, "timestamp": "03:54:08", "text": "或许他们让你觉得眼熟。寿司"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14050.81, "timestamp": "03:54:10", "text": "龙。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14052.309, "timestamp": "03:54:12", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14055.269, "timestamp": "03:54:15", "text": "Disha Dragon是Twitch上的一位主播，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14058.389, "timestamp": "03:54:18", "text": "嗯，那好像是成年人的事儿。呃，他有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14060.55, "timestamp": "03:54:20", "text": "他自己的装备。他进行现场剪辑和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14062.229, "timestamp": "03:54:22", "text": "一切。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14065.429, "timestamp": "03:54:25", "text": "是的。所以他真的都是自己做事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14069.11, "timestamp": "03:54:29", "text": "科技产品之类的东西。以便"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14071.67, "timestamp": "03:54:31", "text": "我当时就想，我终于明白他是怎么做到的了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14074.79, "timestamp": "03:54:34", "text": "东西。以前他有三个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14077.03, "timestamp": "03:54:37", "text": "电脑之类的东西。所以三和六"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14081.83, "timestamp": "03:54:41", "text": "OBSS，以及每个 OBSS 都必须经过的处理过程"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14084.07, "timestamp": "03:54:44", "text": "比如努力之类的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14087.67, "timestamp": "03:54:47", "text": "现在他好像在使用某种视觉效果。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14091.59, "timestamp": "03:54:51", "text": "运行这些东西的VDJ软件"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14093.99, "timestamp": "03:54:53", "text": "他好像有个服务器系统。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14096.79, "timestamp": "03:54:56", "text": "又是三台电脑，不过都能运行。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14098.71, "timestamp": "03:54:58", "text": "努力以及所有类似的事情，仅此而已"}]